    "Exact submitted name, optional color and icon survive reopen with one Core-issued identity and lifetime. Required text/color validation runs before receipts or proposals; equal names remain separate sources.",
    "The name field hash matches independently framed literal bytes with Category kind byte 04 and issued dataset/source/lifetime IDs. Portable source content has exactly name/color/iconName, with null completion/archive flags.",
