    "Every implemented existing domain command retains the Category ID/lifetime/content/timestamps in its acknowledged checkpoint; unrelated Item, List, membership, completion/archive and Schedule writers cannot omit Category data from the required snapshot/publish arguments.",
    "Genuine schema-7 migration preserves memberships/local Done, Item content/state/hash/timestamps, links, both Schedule forms, deletion metadata and replayable receipts. Historical portable bytes remain unchanged, and Share-role Category saving works only after main migration."
  ],
